\date{2025-11-14T19:40:53Z}
\title{Swarm polytypes}

\import{swarm-macros}

\p{Most generally, a Swarm polytype is of the form

##{\swpoly{\overline{\alpha}; \overline{\delta}}{\Delta}{\tau}}

where #{\overline{\alpha}} is a sequence of type variables, #{\overline{\delta}} is a sequence of [capability](001D) set variables, #{\Delta} is a [capability set expression](001Y), and #{\tau} is a monotype.

}